@startuml
title Hospital Fixed-Asset Tracking System\nOverall Communication Overview

top to bottom direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam roundcorner 14

actor "Hospital User" as User

package "Web Applications" {
    component "Registration App" as RegApp
    component "Monitor App" as MonApp
}

component "FastAPI Backend" as Backend
database "PostgreSQL" as Database
cloud "MQTT Broker" as MQTT

package "Sensor Nodes" {
    component "Registration Desk Node" as RegNode
    component "Checkpoint Node" as CheckNode
}

rectangle "RFID-Tagged Assets" as Assets

User --> RegApp : Registration and\nmanagement actions
User --> MonApp : Monitoring and\nmovement requests

RegApp <--> Backend : HTTPS / JSON
MonApp <--> Backend : HTTPS / JSON

Backend --> RegApp : WebSocket updates
Backend --> MonApp : WebSocket updates

Backend <--> Database : Persistent data
Backend <--> MQTT : MQTT messages

MQTT <--> RegNode : Scans, commands,\nheartbeats
MQTT <--> CheckNode : Detections, commands,\nheartbeats

Assets --> RegNode : RFID scan
Assets --> CheckNode : RFID detection

@enduml